meta.question:
Call to undefined method Illuminate\Container\Container::storagePath() in feature test

I'm trying to load some images in my feature test with Laravlel 10:
class MyTest extends TestCase

    private string $path;

    protected function setUp(): void
    {
        $this->path = storage_path('image.jpeg');
    }
}

But I get this error message Call to undefined method Illuminate\Container\Container::storagePath()
Feature tests are supposed to load the framework, so this should work. I don't understand, did I miss something?

