answers:
I finally figured it out. It turns out the issue is from the setUp() method. It works when I called the parents setUp() method:
class MyTest extends TestCase

    private string $path;

    protected function setUp(): void
    {
        parent::setUp();
        $this->path = storage_path('image.jpeg');
    }
}

